    f.write("2. **Intent Mismatch**: The worst-performing ad groups have Intent Match Ratio as low as ~0.1 (10% of expected CVR). Investigate landing page relevancy and ad copy for those specific ad groups.\n")
    f.write("3. **Traffic Quality**: Search term review may reveal irrelevant queries; implement negative keywords.\n")
    f.write("4. **Cost Efficiency**: Problematic ad groups have higher CPA and lower ROAS, indicating wasted spend. Consider pausing or optimizing.\n")

print("\nAdditional analysis saved to stage1_additional.md")
''')
