    f.write(f"| CVR | {overall_cvr:.4f} | {problematic['CVR'].mean():.4f} |\n")
    f.write(f"| Intent Match Ratio | - | {problematic['Intent_Match_Ratio'].mean():.4f} |\n")
    f.write(f"| CPC | {overall_cpc:.4f} | {problematic['CPC'].mean():.4f} |\n")
    f.write(f"| CPA | {overall_cpa:.4f} | {problematic['CPA'].mean():.4f} |\n")
    f.write(f"| ROAS | {overall_roas:.4f} | {problematic['ROAS'].mean():.4f} |\n")
    f.write("\n## Keyword Match Type Analysis\n")
    f.write("### Performance within Problematic Ad Groups\n")
    f.write(match_summary.to_markdown(index=False) + "\n")
    f.write("\n### Overall Performance (All Ad Groups)\n")
    f.write(overall_keyword.to_markdown(index=False) + "\n")
    f.write("\nKey Insights:\n")
    f.write("- Broad match and broad match modifier have slightly lower CVR compared to exact and phrase among problematic ad groups.\n")
    f.write("- However, the difference is not drastic; all match types underperform relative to overall averages.\n")
    f.write("\n## Intent Match Ratio Distribution\n")
    f.write(intent_desc.to_markdown() + "\n")
    f.write("\n### Top 10 Worst Performing Ad Groups (Lowest Intent Match Ratio)\n")
    f.write(worst[['ad_group_id','ad_group_name','campaign_name','CTR','CVR','Intent_Match_Ratio']].to_markdown(index=False) + "\n")
    f.write("\n## Traffic Quality Indicators\n")
    f.write("### Search Terms with Clicks but Zero Conversions (Top 10 by clicks)\n")
    if not search_no_conv.empty:
        f.write(search_no_conv.to_markdown(index=False) + "\n")
        f.write("\nThese search terms indicate potential intent mismatch; consider adding them as negative keywords.\n")
    else:
        f.write("No search terms with zero conversions found in sample.\n")
    f.write("\n## Recommendations\n")
    f.write("1. **Keyword Strategy**: Shift budget from broad match to exact and phrase match for problematic ad groups, as they show marginally better CVR.\n")
    f.write("2. **Negative Keywords**: Review search term report for irrelevant queries and add negative keywords to improve traffic quality.\n")
    f.write("3. **Ad Copy & Landing Page Alignment**: For ad groups with extremely low Intent Match Ratio (e.g., those with zero conversions), audit ad copy and landing page relevance. Ensure messaging matches user intent.\n")
    f.write("4. **Audience Segmentation**: Use audience signals to refine targeting; consider excluding low-intent segments.\n")
    f.write("5. **Bid Adjustments**: Lower bids for ad groups with high CTR but low CVR; reallocate budget to higher-performing ad groups.\n")
    f.write("6. **A/B Testing**: Test different ad creatives and landing page variants to improve conversion rates.\n")
    f.write("7. **Campaign Structure Review**: Some campaigns appear frequently in problematic list (e.g., 'Performance Audience - Q2 2023'). Review campaign settings and targeting criteria.\n")
    f.write("\n## Next Steps\n")
    f.write("- Implement negative keyword lists based on search term analysis.\n")
    f.write("- Conduct a landing page audit for the top 20 worst-performing ad groups.\n")
    f.write("- Set up conversion tracking for brand vs non-brand keywords to better understand intent.\n")
    f.write("- Monitor changes in CVR and CPA over the next 30 days after optimizations.\n")

print("Final report written to stage1.md")
