## 1. Methodology

### Data Sources
- `google_ads__campaign_report` – monthly campaign performance (714 rows)
- `google_ads__keyword_report` – keyword‑level metrics (avg_position)
- `google_ads__geo_report` – geographic performance (2,550 rows)
- `google_ads__device_report` – device performance (2,142 rows)

### Health Score Model
We constructed a composite score from three weighted dimensions, each normalized (0‑100) using min‑max scaling.

**Cost Efficiency (40%)**
- ROAS (20% weight, higher is better)
- Cost per conversion (15%, lower is better)
- CPC (5%, lower is better)

**Conversion Quality (35%)**
- Conversion rate (20%, higher is better)
- Quality score (15%, higher is better)

**Competitiveness (25%)**
- Impression share (10%, higher is better)
- CTR (8%, higher is better)
- Average position (7%, lower is better)

The final health score ranges from 0‑100.

### Risk Classification
- **High Risk**: Health score < 40
- **Medium Risk**: 40 ≤ Health score < 70
- **Low Risk**: Health score ≥ 70

## 2. Performance Analysis by Dimension

### 2.1 Campaign Type Analysis
| Campaign Type       | Count | Avg Health Score | Avg ROAS | Avg CTR  | Risk Distribution                     |
|---------------------|-------|------------------|----------|----------|---------------------------------------|
| Display             | 46    | 33.2             | 0.51     | 0.012    | 85% High, 15% Medium                  |
| Video               | 48    | 41.3             | 0.52     | 0.008    | 38% High, 62% Medium                  |
| Performance Max     | 28    | 45.5             | 0.48     | 0.025    | 25% High, 75% Medium                  |
| **Search**          | **33**| **57.7**         | **0.60** | **0.035**| 9% High, 73% Medium, 18% Low          |

**Insight**: Search campaigns perform best among underperformers, while Display campaigns have the lowest health scores and highest risk concentration.

### 2.2 Bidding Strategy Analysis
| Bidding Strategy      | Count | Avg Health Score | Avg ROAS | Avg Cost  |
|-----------------------|-------|------------------|----------|-----------|
| Enhanced CPC          | 17    | 30.3             | 0.43     | $41,957   |
| Target ROAS           | 44    | 39.9             | 0.42     | $39,737   |
| Manual CPC            | 32    | 42.7             | 0.62     | $42,144   |
| Target CPA            | 45    | 48.9             | 0.60     | $44,288   |
| **Maximize Conversions** | **17**| **50.3**         | **0.52** | **$51,472** |

**Insight**: Enhanced CPC and Target ROAS strategies show the poorest health scores. Maximize Conversions performs best but still delivers low ROAS.

### 2.3 Industry Analysis
