| Healthcare     | 17    | 50.3             | 0.52     | $51,472     |
| **Finance**    | **16**| **65.6**         | **0.69** | **$50,017** |

**Insight**: Education and Real Estate campaigns have the worst performance despite moderate costs. Finance campaigns perform relatively well but still fail the ROI threshold.

### 2.4 Geographic Distribution (Underperforming Campaigns Only)
